{:strongs 7280, :hebrew "ארגיעה", :lang :zh-Hans, :gloss "properly, to toss violently and suddenly (the sea with waves, the skin with boils); figuratively (in a favorable manner) to settle, i.e. quiet; specifically, to wink (from the motion of the eye-lids)", :text "字面上，猛烈而突然地翻腾（海面起波浪，皮肤生疱疹）；比喻义（以积极的方式）安定，即平静；特指眨眼（因眼皮的动作）。", :model "glm-5.2", :timestamp "2026-07-27T02:25:18.475071651Z"}